Note: By use of the P?S/8 \i GET\i0  command (or adding the equivalent options to the P?S/8 PAL command line), a core-image of the program can be created at the end of the assembly process to allow further program development.  Debugging and related binary program options are described in a separate document.\page\ul 2.00 Command-line option descriptions\ulnone\par
